  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nThe Red Mood recipe is inspired by the aesthetic of Hong Kong cinema that utilizes a red overtone, constructing a mix of sombre and romantic emotions to portray the mood of the 1960s. The Red Mood gives you with a nostalgic and vintage allure that resonates with the film’s iconic visuals, amplifying emotional intensity and tension in the images. The beauty of this impactful red is sure to be unforgettable.\nThis recipe is most recommended for indoors, under artificial lighting during nighttime.",
